// Neutral runtime: no inference backend exists for this target, so nothing is
// installed and `qwen_image/api` answers every request with that diagnostic.
// macOS and Linux resolve `import "qwen_image_runtime/runtime"` to their own
// file (runtime_macos.cplus, runtime_linux.cplus); a new platform starts by
// copying one of those, not this file.

fn install() {
    return;
}
